meta {
  name: Override Write Request
  type: http
  seq: 18
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/write-requests/{{writeRequestId}}/override
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "notes": "Urgent fix; reviewer unavailable."
  }
}

docs {
  Run a PENDING request without an approver, own requests included. Admin only (403 otherwise); `notes` is the required reason (400 without it). Audited as `WRITE_OVERRIDE`. Production direct-write and PHI-masking rails are unaffected.

  Same connection check as Approve: 409 if the request's connection changed since it was submitted, or no longer exists. Nothing runs and the request stays PENDING.

  Requires a valid Bearer JWT ({{token}}).
  Requires **write mode** to be enabled.
}
